\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Vers e 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab O HAPPY day that fixed my choice
\par \pard\li720 On Thee, my Saviour and my God !
\par Well may this glowing heart rejoice,
\par And tell its raptures all abroad.\b 
\par \pard\cf1\ul 
\par \'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone 
\par \pard\li1440 Happy day! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away ;
\par He taught me how to watch and pray,
\par And live rejoicing every day ;
\par Happy day ! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away.
\par \pard       
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab O happy bond that seals my vows
\par \pard\li720 To Him who merits all my love !
\par Let cheerful anthems fill His house,
\par While to that sacred shrine I move.
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li1440\b Happy day! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away ;
\par He taught me how to watch and pray,
\par And live rejoicing every day ;
\par Happy day ! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away.
\par \pard\b0 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab "Tis done, the great transaction's done !
\par \pard\li720 I am my Lord's and He is mine ;
\par He drew me and I followed on,
\par Charmed to confess the voice divine.
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li1440\b Happy day! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away ;
\par He taught me how to watch and pray,
\par And live rejoicing every day ;
\par Happy day ! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away.
\par \pard\b0 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Now rest, my long-divided heart ;
\par \pard\li720 Fixed on this blissful centre, rest :
\par Nor ever from they Lord depart,
\par With Him of every good possessed.
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li1440\b Happy day! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away ;
\par He taught me how to watch and pray,
\par And live rejoicing every day ;
\par Happy day ! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away.
\par \pard\b0 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab High heaven, that heard the solemn vow,
\par \pard\li720 That vow renewed shall daily hear, 
\par Till in life's latest hour I bow,
\par And bless in death a bond so dear.
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li1440\b Happy day! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away ;
\par He taught me how to watch and pray,
\par And live rejoicing every day ;
\par Happy day ! Happy day !
\par When Jesus washed my sins away.
\par \pard\b0 
\par \f1 
